# ADHD Content Engine

Follow `docs/ADHD-CONTENT-ENGINE.md` and `docs/ADHD-KNOWLEDGE-ARCHITECTURE.md` for all ADHD blogs, FAQs, and pillars.

**Gate:** definitive topic ownership OR material pillar strength — else don’t publish.

**Pipeline:** Gap → Brief → SEO → Outline → Link Map → Medical checklist → Draft (brief+outline first unless “draft now”).

**SOP links:** 1 pillar · 2 blogs · 1 FAQ · 1 service · 1 local if live.

**CTA:** Awareness=screening · Trust=Meet & Greet · Evaluation=/adhd-care.

**Quality:** Own the entity intersection; prevalence, tables, myths, practical day, meds search angles, evaluation process, EEAT, conversion close — not encyclopedia-only.

**Local pages:** Follow `docs/LOCAL-ADHD-TREATMENT-PAGE-ENGINE.md` (Phase 5; anti-doorway).
